@startuml C4-Dynamic-IamNativeSignIn
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — AI iOS Sign in with Explore IAM (PKCE)

actor "User" as user
participant "AI iOS\nLoginView / AuthService" as ios <<ui>>
participant "Explore IAM\n:9100" as iam <<java>>
participant "AI Backend\n:9000" as api <<java>>

user -> ios: 1. Tap Sign in with IAM
ios -> ios: 2. PKCE verifier / challenge / state
ios -> iam: 3. ASWebAuthenticationSession\nGET /oauth2/authorize\nclient_id=explore-ai-ios
iam --> ios: 4. /login SPA → credentials
user -> iam: 5. demo / demo
iam --> ios: 6. com.explore.ai://oauth/callback?code=
ios -> iam: 7. POST /oauth2/token + code_verifier
iam --> ios: 8. access_token (email/profile claims)
ios -> api: 9. GET /api/account/me\nAuthorization: Bearer
api -> iam: 10. JWKS / issuer validate
api -> api: 11. JWT → AccountUser / OwnerKey
api --> ios: 12. 200 me payload
ios --> user: 13. Navigate HomeView

note over ios, api
  Bearer requests skip CSRF.
  Resource server: IamResourceServerConfig.
end note

@enduml
